1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Click an element. Change its color.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,500
Glide writes it to your source file.

3
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,400
Install Glide.

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,000
Add one plugin to vite.config.ts.

5
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,300
Start your dev server.

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,800
Open the editor link it prints.

7
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:32,000
No Vite? Run npx @srivarsank/glide 5173

8
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,000
Double-click text to edit it.

9
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:39,400
Press Enter. It’s in the file.

10
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,400
Set a color in the panel.

11
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:46,200
Glide writes your theme’s class.

12
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:52,000
Change the size at md only.

13
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:55,300
Only md:text-6xl changes.

14
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,800
Every other class stays.

15
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,800
Drag an element to move it.

16
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:06,800
Glide saves the offset as classes.

17
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:13,300
Inside a component, pick a scope.

18
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,600
This usage, the component, or a variant.

19
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:22,000
Every lg button grows. One line changes.

20
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:27,300
Want to review first? Use Staged.

21
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:31,100
Staged edits wait. Compare them.

22
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:34,400
Apply writes them all at once.

23
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:38,000
Undo, redo, and a full history.

24
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:43,100
Edit the file yourself.

25
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:46,700
The canvas follows. No reload.

26
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:51,500
Can’t be exact? Glide refuses.

27
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:54,900
Your file stays untouched.

28
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:59,900
React, Vue, Svelte, Astro.

29
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:04,300
Insert, move and group: JSX and TSX only.
